Files vendored unmodified: taa1.c, taa1.h, hurdle.c, hurdle.h, common.c, common.h.

These are Midnight Blue's reverse-engineered, publicly-released implementations of the TETRA
Authentication Algorithm suite (TAA1) and the HURDLE block cipher it is built on, produced as
part of the RE:TETRA / TETRA:BURST research (NLnet-funded, NGI0 PET fund). See
https://www.midnightblue.nl/research/tetraburst and
https://github.com/MidnightBlueLabs/TETRA_crypto for background.

flowstation does not modify these files; `build.rs` in the parent crate compiles them as-is and
`src/lib.rs` provides safe Rust bindings on top.
